# NOVA — Enterprise AI Knowledge Assistant

NOVA is an enterprise-style AI knowledge assistant built with **Spring Boot, Spring AI, React, and TypeScript**. It uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to answer questions using uploaded PDF documents. PDF text is extracted and split into chunks, stored in ChromaDB, and retrieved as context for responses generated through Groq's OpenAI-compatible API.

The application also includes JWT-based authentication, role-based access control (RBAC), document management, and chat history persistence.

