## Features

- Register and sign in with email/password.
- Authenticate API requests with JWT bearer tokens.
- Role-based authorization for protected operations.
- Upload PDF documents and extract their text.
- Split extracted text into overlapping chunks.
- Store and retrieve document chunks using ChromaDB similarity search.
- Answer questions using a RAG workflow with Spring AI and Groq.
- Support regular and streaming chat flows.
- View uploaded documents and inspect document details.
- Restrict document deletion to users with the `ADMIN` role.
- Persist chat history using Spring Data JPA and H2.
- Provide a React + TypeScript web interface for chat and document management.

